@base = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@origin = http://localhost:5174
@token = replace_access_token
@date = 2026-10-25

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Airports
GET {{base}}/airports?q=da+nang

### Login (use password generated in DEMO-ACCOUNTS.md)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"demo@flight.local","password":"replace_generated_password"}

### Search — update @date before use
GET {{base}}/flights?origin=SGN&destination=HAN&date={{date}}&passengers=1&cabinClass=ECONOMY

### Current user
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My bookings
GET {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin dashboard
GET {{base}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
